BCP753-City Hall Park.Elevation 858.748 m GSC BRASS TABLET MKD 809-C ON A CONC PILLAR. 40.0 CM AGL.6.1 M SOUTH OF SOUTH FACE OF CURB OF ROSS STREET</groundspeak:encoded_hints>
